## Amendments

Append one entry per change to scope or order. Never renumber completed items;
insert with a letter suffix (`4b`, `4c`) and state downstream impact.

- **YYYY-MM-DD — [phase/item change].** Trigger: [what forced it]. Adds
  [items]. Supersedes [items]. [Downstream phases/items affected].

---

## Definition of done

- [ ] Every checklist item has a commit hash or `manual`.
- [ ] Every phase gate is verified with dated evidence.
- [ ] Every enabled pack has labeled items and gate evidence; every disabled pack
      has a reason and a revisit trigger.
- [ ] Every locked decision is recorded in `docs/project.json`.
- [ ] Every deferred item has a reason and a revisit trigger.
- [ ] All routes in `02-sitemap-and-routes.md` exist and are owned per
      `04-architecture-contracts.md`.
- [ ] The full gate passes: [fast, full, edge, build commands].
- [ ] No secrets, dumps, uploads, or local state committed.
- [ ] A fresh clone reproduces the setup with the documented commands.

